    "updated_at": "2023-10-16T14:15:00Z",
    "body": "This is why `Sec-` exists. Why wasn't this considered when the `Priority` request header was being implemented? I.e., how can we avoid this in the future?\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/http ",
