    "created_at": "2024-06-03T13:40:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-03T13:40:27Z",
    "body": "To fix this:\r\n\r\n1. Tests need to be written in web-platform-tests to ensure the header does not get overwritten when set directly.\r\n2. https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-http-network-or-cache-fetch needs to be patched to account for this header, similar to how it already accounts for `User-Agent` and other headers.\r\n\r\ncc @domfarolino ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
